Finsight – Expense Tracking and Budgeting Web Application

About the Project

Finsight is a web-based expense tracking and budgeting application developed to help users manage their daily expenses and monthly budgets.

Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- PHP
- MySQL
- JavaScript
- XAMPP

Features

- User Registration and Login
- Dashboard
- Add Expenses
- Edit and Delete Expenses
- Set Monthly Budget
- View Expense Reports
- Download Reports

Tools Used

- Visual Studio Code
- XAMPP
- MySQL

